<header><p class="enc-kicker">State</p><h1 class="enc-title">Eighteenth Dynasty of Egypt</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Eighteenth Dynasty</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Eighteenth Dynasty was the ruling house of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/egypt">Egypt</a> that founded the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/new-kingdom-of-egypt">New Kingdom</a> after the expulsion of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hyksos">Hyksos</a>. Its rulers, including <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ahmose-i">Ahmose I</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hatshepsut">Hatshepsut</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/thutmose-iii">Thutmose III</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/akhenaten">Akhenaten</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tutankhamun">Tutankhamun</a>, built the Egyptian Empire New Kingdom, extending Egyptian power into the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/levant">Levant</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nubia">Nubia</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/eighteenth-dynasty-of-egypt.jpg" alt="Eighteenth Dynasty of Egypt" width="320" height="320" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Djehouty · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Respaldo_del_trono_de_oro_de_Tutankam%C3%B3n.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>Ahmose I, founding pharaoh of the <b>Eighteenth Dynasty</b>, completed this expulsion around 1550 BCE, reunited the country, reconquered Nubian territories lost during the preceding fragmentation, and began rebuilding the administrative and military institutions that would sustain the empire for nearly five centuries.</blockquote><a href="/empire/egyptian-empire-new-kingdom">Egyptian Empire New Kingdom · Foundation</a></li><li><blockquote>His reign is counted as the start of the <b>Eighteenth Dynasty</b> and the Egyptian Empire New Kingdom.</blockquote><a href="/state/seventeenth-dynasty-of-egypt">Seventeenth Dynasty of Egypt</a></li></ul></section>
